WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.180
Make a Wish kids: Good morning, Hank! It's Monday!

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:09.320
So Hank, you just got said hello to by several Nerdfighters, including Esther, or as she's known on the internet, crazycrayon!

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:14.440
Hank, you know Esther. She helps run the constantly updating spew of awesome known as Eff Yeah Nerdfighters, link in the Doobly-Doo.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:24.620
She also has cancer, which sucks. This weekend, a bunch of her friends got to go up to Boston to visit her and I went and visited with them for a day, and it was an amazing day of amazing.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:31.300
And it made me really proud to be a Nerdfighter to see these relationships that began online in Nerdfighteria be so sustaining and meaningful IRL.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:38.960
So what'd we do? Oh we all wrote silly questions on this volleyball and then we would throw each other the volleyball and answer the questions, like I had to answer what color my underwear was.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:45.840
John: "The question is, what color is your underwear, and underneath that it says, PANTIES!

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:51.880
I guess in case you don't know what underwear is. Uh, it's black with little white palm trees. "

00:00:56.840 --> 00:01:00.040
Then we had to decide which Harry Potter Esther would be. She's a big Harry Potter fan. More on that in a second.

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:05.080
Esther: "I don't know who I'd be. Maybe I'd be a mix of Luna and someone else."

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:07.700
John: "Half Luna, half Dumbledore? "

00:01:07.700 --> 00:01:10.800
Esther: "Yeah, that would be very beautiful."

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.480
Then we tried to have a puff fight but it turned into a head-butting contest, as puff fights so often do.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:20.240
Esther: "Yeah, I dunno. Yours has a lot more shape to it. "

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:25.660
John: "Ow! Too much, too much, that was a head butt. Yeah, not good."

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:28.760
Then we went on this insane adventure through the twilight streets of Boston

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:31.480
trying to find this one place that had espresso and gelato.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:34.480
And then we all had espresso and felt terribly sophisticated.

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:39.060
Anyway, all night long I was thinking about how grateful I am to know Esther, and trying to figure out a way to like,

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:45.820
give thanks for our weird internet-based cross-generational friendship.

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:48.700
And then I remembered the first amazing night of amazing I spent with Esther

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.680
was at LeakyCon, a Harry Potter conference.

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:57.080
And after all, if it weren't for Harry Potter, I would have no Esther, and also there probably wouldn't be a Nerdfighteria.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:01.040
Then I thought about the fact that Esther's a huge supporter of the Harry Potter Alliance,

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:04.220
a charitable organization that Nerdfighteria often partners with.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:12.160
Like, remember when Nerdfighteria and the Harry Potter Alliance raised $123,000 to help Haiti heal and we had the SS DFTBA load up and go over to Haiti?

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:13.880
Right, that Harry Potter Alliance.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:18.260
Hank, the HPA is currently in this huge contest to potentially win $250,000

00:02:18.260 --> 00:02:22.440
to dramatically improve the amount of World Suck they can decrease.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:31.220
The HPA is currently in 3rd place, but what if we all go, link in the dooblydoo, and we vote, and we tell our friends to vote, and they win the $250,000,

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:36.960
which allows them to continue their work, getting books to kids around the world from the Mississippi Delta

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:41.380
to Rwanda and allows them to grow the work they do advocating for human rights around the world.

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:46.700
And also, it is a small little way of saying to Esther, "Hi, thank you for being awesome."

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:53.140
I'm not gonna say that we should win this contest for Esther, because if I say that, she will throw up in the back of her mouth and hate me.

00:02:53.140 --> 00:02:55.760
I think we should win this contest with Esther.

00:02:55.760 --> 00:03:00.440
So, if you wanna give thanks for the existence of Nerdfighteria and the existence of Esther

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:07.200
and the existence of wonderful boy wizards, please go to the link in the dooblydoo and vote for the Harry Potter Alliance.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.920
So please go vote and thanks again to everyone in Boston.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.500
It was so fun to hang out with you guys.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:19.040
Hank, you'll find this out at VidCon, but it is so pleasant to spend time with people who are wearing your face on their chest. I'll see you on Wednesday

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:25.580
Or as they call her on the internet, crazycrayon! I look kind of like I'm robbing a bank right now.

00:03:25.580 --> 00:03:30.400
How would you describe the assailant, sir?
Mmm, about six foot one, pretty nerdy, fair bit of puff.

00:03:30.400 --> 00:03:31.240
